、烹饪产品、谷物及相关产品。","营养产品：交易和经营营养产品。","其他：其他业务。"],"lines_en":["Food and Beverages: manufactures and sells ice-cream, powdered milk and drinks, liquid milk and juices, instant coffee and other beverages, chocolate confectionery products, instant noodles, culinary products, cereals, and related products.","Nutrition products: trades and deals in nutrition products.","Others: other business activities."]}}